      ],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "When critical storage levels were exceeded, the state's failure made tangible: a show of force after the fact, where late-responding enforcers mounted emergency maritime rescues. A ruler inspecting the ruins of his domain saw a collapse emblematic of state decay and structural failure. The predictable consequence of climate neglect resulted in fatalities among minors, the youngest victims of a system pushed to breaking point by mismanagement.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
